1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,559
A chat widget is a small chat window that floats in the corner of the page.

2
00:00:05,559 --> 00:00:07,754
This video shows the two widgets:

3
00:00:07,754 --> 00:00:12,256
the admin widget, which gives your staff an assistant on every admin page,

4
00:00:12,256 --> 00:00:16,759
and the website widget, which puts an assistant in front of your visitors.

5
00:00:16,759 --> 00:00:21,599
It covers the features, the settings, the permission your visitors need, and how

6
00:00:21,599 --> 00:00:23,850
the public assistant is protected.

7
00:00:28,450 --> 00:00:31,249
The admin widget floats on every admin page.

8
00:00:31,249 --> 00:00:35,505
Your staff can ask a question without leaving what they are doing, and

9
00:00:35,505 --> 00:00:39,200
with the right tools the assistant can even act on the site.

10
00:00:39,950 --> 00:00:43,987
The website widget is an ordinary Orchard Core widget that you place in

11
00:00:43,987 --> 00:00:49,020
a zone of your site, for example to answer questions about your products or opening hours.

12
00:00:49,770 --> 00:00:53,105
Both talk to an AI profile of the type Chat.

13
00:00:53,105 --> 00:00:55,173
Create the profile first.

14
00:00:55,173 --> 00:01:02,110
Its instructions, chat mode, file uploads, read-aloud and ratings all apply inside the widget too.

15
00:01:06,394 --> 00:01:09,970
The admin widget is the feature AI Chat Admin Widget.

16
00:01:09,970 --> 00:01:14,031
It depends on AI Chat and on Orchard Core AI Agent, which are

17
00:01:14,031 --> 00:01:15,910
enabled together with it.

18
00:01:15,910 --> 00:01:18,274
Search for it in Tools, Features.

19
00:01:18,739 --> 00:01:23,249
The website widget needs no AI feature of its own beyond AI Chat.

20
00:01:23,249 --> 00:01:28,585
It is a widget, so the Widgets and Layers features of Orchard Core must be on.

21
00:01:28,585 --> 00:01:30,809
Many sites have them already.

22
00:01:34,989 --> 00:01:40,118
Open Settings, Artificial Intelligence, and find the Admin Widget section.

23
00:01:40,118 --> 00:01:43,901
Chat profile chooses the profile the widget talks to.

24
00:01:43,901 --> 00:01:48,069
Choose No profile, disabled, to hide the widget completely.

25
00:01:48,528 --> 00:01:53,197
Once you pick a profile, Max history sessions says how many past chats

26
00:01:53,197 --> 00:01:57,805
the history list shows, from one to fifty, and Primary color sets the

27
00:01:57,805 --> 00:02:00,324
color of the header and the button.

28
00:02:00,324 --> 00:02:01,368
Click Save.

29
00:02:05,572 --> 00:02:10,091
The widget now shows on every admin page, for each signed-in user who

30
00:02:10,091 --> 00:02:12,321
is allowed to use that profile.

31
00:02:12,321 --> 00:02:17,262
Click the round robot button, Open AI Assistant, in the bottom right corner.

32
00:02:17,713 --> 00:02:20,343
Type your question and press Enter.

33
00:02:20,343 --> 00:02:25,280
The widget has the same message box as the chat page, with attachments,

34
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:29,833
voice, read-aloud, copy and ratings when the profile allows them.

35
00:02:31,533 --> 00:02:36,127
In the header, New chat starts over, and Chat history lists your recent

36
00:02:36,127 --> 00:02:38,454
chats so that you can reopen one.

37
00:02:38,454 --> 00:02:42,810
Drag the header to move the window, and drag its edge to resize it.

38
00:02:42,810 --> 00:02:46,033
The widget remembers its place on the next page.

39
00:02:50,238 --> 00:02:51,864
Open Design, Widgets.

40
00:02:51,864 --> 00:02:56,440
Make sure a layer is active on the pages where the chat should appear.

41
00:02:56,440 --> 00:03:00,535
A layer whose rule is a Boolean condition set to true shows on

42
00:03:00,535 --> 00:03:03,848
every page, and many sites have one named Always.

43
00:03:04,298 --> 00:03:08,562
In the zone where the widget should live, for example Footer, click Add

44
00:03:08,562 --> 00:03:11,498
Widget and choose Artificial Intelligence Chat.

45
00:03:11,948 --> 00:03:15,793
Profile chooses the chat profile, and it is required.

46
00:03:15,793 --> 00:03:21,463
Total history chat to show is how many past chats a signed-in visitor can reopen.

47
00:03:21,463 --> 00:03:24,135
Set it to zero to hide the history.

48
00:03:24,135 --> 00:03:27,068
Pick the layer, and publish the widget.

49
00:03:31,269 --> 00:03:35,772
Visitors who are not signed in use the Anonymous role, and the widget

50
00:03:35,772 --> 00:03:39,254
shows only to people whose role may use the profile.

51
00:03:39,254 --> 00:03:44,657
Open Access Control, Roles, edit Anonymous, and find the permission Query AI profile

52
00:03:44,657 --> 00:03:46,459
for your public profile.

53
00:03:46,909 --> 00:03:49,034
Grant only that one profile.

54
00:03:49,034 --> 00:03:53,720
Do not grant Query any AI profile to the Anonymous role, because that

55
00:03:53,720 --> 00:03:56,219
opens every profile to the public.

56
00:04:00,420 --> 00:04:05,419
On a page of the site, a round chat button sits in the bottom right corner.

57
00:04:05,419 --> 00:04:10,233
Clicking it opens a chat window titled AI Chat, with the welcome message

58
00:04:10,233 --> 00:04:12,640
of the profile and a message box.

59
00:04:13,090 --> 00:04:17,275
A visitor types a question and sees the answer as it is written.

60
00:04:17,275 --> 00:04:21,579
A chat is saved only once the visitor sends a first message, never

61
00:04:21,579 --> 00:04:24,030
just because someone opened a page.

62
00:04:28,230 --> 00:04:32,428
A public assistant is open to anyone, so the site limits how many

63
00:04:32,428 --> 00:04:36,803
messages a visitor can send, and how many chats a visitor can start,

64
00:04:36,803 --> 00:04:38,104
in a short time.

65
00:04:38,104 --> 00:04:41,770
A visitor over the limit is asked to wait a few minutes.

66
00:04:42,520 --> 00:04:47,858
Messages that try to trick the assistant into ignoring its instructions are blocked.

67
00:04:47,858 --> 00:04:52,840
A cookie recognizes a visitor across visits, for the analytics and the limits.

68
00:04:53,590 --> 00:04:55,545
Keep a public assistant focused.

69
00:04:55,545 --> 00:04:59,608
Give it clear instructions about what it may talk about, and restrict its

70
00:04:59,608 --> 00:05:03,260
answers to your own content when it should answer only from that.

71
00:05:07,460 --> 00:05:11,698
A shop puts a website assistant in the footer, to answer questions about

72
00:05:11,698 --> 00:05:14,850
opening hours, returns and repairs around the clock.

73
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:19,934
An editor keeps the admin assistant open while writing, and asks it how

74
00:05:19,934 --> 00:05:22,580
a setting works without leaving the page.

75
00:05:23,330 --> 00:05:27,609
A support lead gives the admin assistant tools, so that staff can list

76
00:05:27,609 --> 00:05:30,030
content or check a setting by asking.

77
00:05:32,030 --> 00:05:36,968
Choose a profile, turn on a widget, and give visitors the one permission they need.

78
00:05:36,968 --> 00:05:38,410
Thanks for watching.

